# GitHub Actions FTP deploy — repository secrets
#
# Required:
# FTP_SERVER       e.g. ftp.zhengkyc.com
# FTP_USERNAME     FTP account username
# FTP_PASSWORD     FTP account password
# FTP_SERVER_DIR   Remote app root WITH trailing slash, e.g. /public_html/ispbilling/
#
# Recommended (FTP-only hosts — no SSH/cPanel Terminal):
# DEPLOY_EXTRACT_TOKEN   Long random string (e.g. openssl rand -hex 32)
#                        After deploy, open in your browser:
#                        https://YOUR-DOMAIN/deploy-extract-vendor.php?token=YOUR_TOKEN
#                        This unpacks vendor.zip into vendor/ (one file instead of 8000+ FTP files).
#
# Optional:
# FTP_PORT         Default 21
# FTP_PROTOCOL     Default ftp (use ftps if required)
#
# No terminal? Use cPanel File Manager instead:
# 1. Open your app folder on the server
# 2. Select vendor.zip → Extract
# 3. Delete vendor.zip when done
#
# First-time server setup (edit .env via File Manager / FTP):
# - APP_KEY, DB_*, APP_URL, M-Pesa keys
# - php artisan commands are NOT available without terminal; use File Manager for .env only.
# - Point domain document root to the public/ folder inside this app.
